@guide A_43_Tanaris
@name Tanaris (49-50)
@faction Alliance
@levels 49-50
@zone Tanaris
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Tanaris, visit 2 of 3 on the Alliance route, levels 49-50.
@next A_44_Hinterlands

fly Gadgetzan | Take the flight from Theramore.
travel Tanaris
accept 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
accept 82 Noxious Lair Investigation
complete 82 Noxious Lair Investigation | Centipaar insects at the Noxious Lair.
turnin 82 Noxious Lair Investigation
accept 10 The Scrimshank Redemption
complete 10 The Scrimshank Redemption | Inside the Noxious Lair tunnels.
turnin 10 The Scrimshank Redemption
accept 110 Insect Part Analysis
turnin 110 Insect Part Analysis | Alchemist Pestlezugg.
accept 113 Insect Part Analysis
turnin 113 Insect Part Analysis
accept 3161 Gahz'ridian [optional] | Marvon Rivetseeker, south of Gadgetzan. Needs level 43.
note The next quest, Tooga's Quest, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 1560 Tooga's Quest
complete 1560 Tooga's Quest | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete 3161 Gahz'ridian [optional] | Wear the Gahz'ridian Detector helmet he gives you and dig up Gahz'ridian Ornaments in the Gahz'ridian ruins, south-west.
turnin 3161 Gahz'ridian [optional]
accept 2605 The Thirsty Goblin [optional] | Marin Noggenfogger, Gadgetzan. Needs level 44.
turnin 1560 Tooga's Quest
complete 2605 The Thirsty Goblin [optional] | Laden Dew Glands from Thistleshrub Dew Collectors in the south-west of Tanaris.
turnin 2605 The Thirsty Goblin [optional]
complete 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
turnin 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
accept 3362 Thistleshrub Valley
accept 2606 In Good Taste
complete 3362 Thistleshrub Valley
turnin 2606 In Good Taste
turnin 3362 Thistleshrub Valley
accept 5863 The Dunemaul Compound
complete 5863 The Dunemaul Compound
turnin 5863 The Dunemaul Compound
level 50 | The Hinterlands starts at 50. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
